; REGISTERED USE ONLY!  This file will not be even read when unregistered
; Registered use gives you many benifits, including the ability to change
; the color of prompts and the ANS/ASC/RIP screens, multiple language 
; support and more...
;
; Remember that these colors must be in the same order, left justified
; and have either nothing or a space after them
;
; Color chart:
;     0 - Black      1 - Blue        2 - Green      3 - Cyan
;     4 - Red        5 - Purple      6 - Brown      7 - Lt.Gray
;     8 - Dk.Gray    9 - Lt.Blue    10 - Lt.Green  11 - Lt.Cyan
;    12 - Lt.Red    13 - Lt.Purple  14 - Yellow    15 - White
;
15      ; Input field foreground
4       ; Input field background
15      ; 'Press space' prompt
15      ; Titles
12      ; Errors
4       ; ÄÄÄÄÄÄ Lines
15      ; Questions
7       ; Data
7       ; Prompts
14      ; Conference numbers
15      ; Conference names
7       ; Flags
15      ; General text
7       ; Options
14      ; UPLOAD/DOWNLOAD mode title
14      ; Spinner bar
11      ; Logoff prompt/info
10      ; Sucessful transfer
8       ; 'Last download' message
14      ; New messages count
14      ; Packed messages count
7       ; Keyword/filter/personal messages count
14      ; Status info messages (Number files/messages/time)
15      ; Values of above
11      ; No mail to pack
11      ; Ask if want to pack
